<title>FINLAND: Outokumpu sees clearly better 97 earnings.</title>
<headline>Outokumpu sees clearly better 97 earnings.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish metals and mining group Outokumpu Oy said on Thursday it expected full-year 1997 earnings to improve clearly on 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;According to the current estimate, the group's result for 1997 will be markedly better than in 1996,&quot; Outokumpu said in a statement with its January-April results.</p>
</text>
